{"type":"message","id":"d870f7c3","parentId":"d191aa4e","timestamp":"2026-05-25T10:36:53.018Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The RSS parsing script failed because `all_articles.txt` is empty. The `ls -l *.xml` command shows that the XML files are populated, which means the `curl` commands worked. This points to an issue within the `parse_feed` function in `parse_rss.sh`. The error message `environment: line 8: \\\\: command not found` suggests a problem with line continuations (backslashes) in the script. I'll rewrite `parse_rss.sh` to remove the problematic backslash at the end of the `xmllint` line to ensure the `while` loop processes the output correctly."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"#!/bin/bash\n\n# Function to parse an RSS feed\nparse_feed() {\n    local filename=\"$1\"\n    local source_name=\"$2\"\n    xmllint --xpath \"//item\" \"$filename\" 2>/dev/null | \\\n    while IFS= read -r item; do\n        title=$(echo \"$item\" | xmllint --xpath \"string(.//title)\" - 2>/dev/null | sed 's/<!\\[CDATA\\[//g;s/\\]\\]>//g;s/&apos;/'\"'\"'/g;s/&quot;/\"/g;s/&amp;/\\&/g;s/&lt;/</g;s/&gt;/>/g')\n        link=$(echo \"$item\" | xmllint --xpath \"string(.//link)\" - 2>/dev/null | sed 's/<!\\[CDATA\\[//g;s/\\]\\]>//g')\n        pubdate=$(echo \"$item\" | xmllint --xpath \"string(.//pubDate)\" - 2>/dev/null | head -n 1)\n\n        if [[ -n \"$title\" && -n \"$link\" && -n \"$pubdate\" ]]; then\n            echo \"$source_name|$title|$link|$pubdate\"\n        fi\n    done\n}\n\n# Process each feed\nparse_feed coindesk.xml \"CoinDesk\" > coindesk_parsed.txt &\nparse_feed cointelegraph.xml \"CoinTelegraph\" > cointelegraph_parsed.txt &\nparse_feed decrypt.xml \"Decrypt\" > decrypt_parsed.txt &\nparse_feed google_news.xml \"Google News\" > google_news_parsed.txt &\nparse_feed beincrypto.xml \"BeInCrypto\" > beincrypto_parsed.txt &\nparse_feed theblock.xml \"The Block\" > theblock_parsed.txt &\nparse_feed cryptoslate.xml \"CryptoSlate\" > cryptoslate_parsed.txt &\nparse_feed cryptofox_markets.xml \"CryptoFox Markets\" > cryptofox_markets_parsed.txt &\nparse_feed cryptofox_regulation.xml \"CryptoFox Regulation\" > cryptofox_regulation_parsed.txt &\n\nwait\n\n# Concatenate all parsed data\ncat *_parsed.txt > all_articles.txt\n","path":"parse_rss.sh"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":9500,"output":927,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10427,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779705407246,"responseId":"QSYUar7BE4HG694PmJmegQo"}}
